            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="e24a-6018-20cf-d76c">If a Ripper Swarm of Sky-slasher Swarm is more than 12&quot; from a Synapse Creature at the beginning of the turn and fails a Leadership test because of the Instinctive Behaviour rule, the unit loses 1 Wound for each point they fail the Leadership test by - no saves allowed.</characteristic>
